00:09:47.967 --> 00:09:50.733
Oke, kalau udah siap... Mulai!

00:09:50.833 --> 00:09:51.900
Pelan-pelan aja.

00:09:54.567 --> 00:09:56.067 line:0
<i>Lena serius main ini!</i>

00:09:55.933 --> 00:09:58.467
Takut... takut... takut. Takut banget.

00:10:04.067 --> 00:10:06.906
- Wah wah wah!
- Lena!

00:10:06.906 --> 00:10:08.067
- Curang!

00:10:20.767 --> 00:10:23.600
Dua, satu! Waktu habis!

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:24.000 line:0
<i>Waktu habis!</i>

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:28.000
- Mati aku!
- Mati aku, capek banget!

